  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1, "type": "text", "title": "About",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Cloud Control Plane — moto / ACK S3 / KRO\n\nThree components that together demonstrate declarative AWS-resource management inside the lab:\n\n- **moto** (namespace `moto`) — token-free AWS API mock; ACK calls it instead of real AWS\n- **ACK S3** (namespace `ack-system`) — reconciles `kind: Bucket` CRs against moto; `ack-demo-bucket` is the live demo object\n- **KRO** (namespace `kro`) — ResourceGraphDefinition composes ACK Bucket + ConfigMap into a single claim; `app-data` (kind `S3BucketClaim`) is the live demo instance\n\nAll metrics come from KSM, cAdvisor, ArgoCD, and Loki sources already scraped by Alloy — no new scrape jobs. If ACK/KRO expose controller-runtime metrics on `:8080`, add a scrape job as a follow-up item."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2, "type": "text", "title": "moto — AWS mock",
      "gridPos": { "h": 2, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "options": { "mode": "markdown", "content": "### moto — AWS mock (namespace `moto`)" }
    },
    {
      "id": 3, "type": "stat", "title": "moto Pod Running",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 5, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" },
      "targets": [ { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "mimir" }, "expr": "max(kube_pod_status_phase{namespace=\"moto\", phase=\"Running\"})", "instant": true } ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [ { "color": "red", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 } ] },
          "mappings": [ { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "DOWN" }, "1": { "text": "UP" } } } ],
          "noValue": "not deployed"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4, "type": "stat", "title": "moto Memory (MiB)",
